Z||000000||theogre||05-19-2001||04:55 PM||||Those of you in the Delaware Valley have no doubt heard of the massive destruction by a fire in the Continental Business Center in Bridgeport PA. (North of Philly a little bit.)<P>One of the casualties of that fire was Jet-Hot's Bridgeport facility. It was reported in the news media that the company is one of those destroyed by the fire.<P>Unfortunatly, If you had pending work at that facility then you have likely lost whatever it was. You should contact Jet Hot for specific details. There is no statement from them on their website at this time.<P>Jet-Hot's web site is <A HREF="http://www.jet-hot.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.jet-hot.com/</A> ||||reg||4
